WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.475
Creation is closed and
the reading is recent.

3
00:00:04.475 --> 00:00:08.749
Every production agent had its
handshake reviewed before it existed,

4
00:00:08.749 --> 00:00:12.212
with a real employee sponsor,
a group, and a separate owner.

5
00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:16.708
No production blueprint holds a
secret, nothing inherits every role,

6
00:00:16.708 --> 00:00:19.625
and no agent holds a
standing directory role.

7
00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:24.250
Every sponsor transfer was confirmed
on time, or handed to the orphan rule.

8
00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:29.675
Both policies are report-only and reviewed,
and no top-priority drift is open.

9
00:00:29.675 --> 00:00:32.295
Next, Chapter 10 brings it all together:

10
00:00:32.295 --> 00:00:35.325
drift and evidence for
the security officer.

11
00:00:35.325 --> 00:00:36.480
Thanks for watching.
